Package: live-busybox
Architecture: amd64 i386
Built-Using: ${built-using}
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: static BusyBox binary for the MX/antiX live-initrd
 BusyBox combines tiny versions of many common UNIX utilities into a single
 small executable.
 .
 This package provides a BusyBox statically linked against musl,
 configured for the MX/antiX live-initrd (mx-iso-template).
 It is a build helper only: it installs into /usr/lib/live-busybox/
 and does not create any applet symlinks, so it does not interfere
 with the system busybox.
 .
 Installed files:
  /usr/lib/live-busybox/bin/busybox        the static binary
  /usr/lib/live-busybox/busybox.links      list of applet paths
  /usr/lib/live-busybox/busybox.config     build configuration
 The build configuration is also embedded: "busybox bbconfig".
